{
 "description": "Lone Echo 2 started by libovr_launch.exe (the AirFrameXR libOVR bridge release build: launcher + bin\\LibOVRRT64_1.dll from _tmp\\lb\\dist), no winmm.dll in the game folder -> lab host + mock headset.",
